37420>>>        //  Hide header & apply nice background style
37420>>>        Send HideHeader to ghoWebApp
37421>>>        WebSet psCSSClass of ghoWebApp to "LoginBackground"
37422>>>    End_Procedure
37423>>>    
37423>>>End_Object
